# The armory's Logistics tab: craft orders, buying, selling, finding. Keys are relative to Mods.Levy.Logistics.

Tab: Logistics
TabHint: Craft orders, buy from shopkeepers, sell to the happiest one.
PageOrders: Orders
PageOrdersHint: Craft sets and weapons into the armory.
PageBuy: Buy
PageBuyHint: Buy guns, ammo and materials from shopkeepers in reach.
PageSell: Sell
PageSellHint: Sell armory items to the best-paying shopkeeper.
PageFind: Find
PageFindHint: Choose an item to find. The Seeker and Spectator potions use it.
Rule: Orders craft at stations within 30 tiles, from the armory, nearby chests and the linked storage network.
OrdersHeader: Orders
New: New
NewHint: Start a new order.
Pause: Pause
Resume: Resume
PauseHint: Pause or resume the selected order.
Delete: Delete
DeleteHint: Delete the selected order. What it made stays in the armory.
Total: Total
Lines: Sets and weapons
AddItem: Add the item on your cursor
AddSet: + Set
AddSetHint: Add the whole armor set of the piece on your cursor.
Bucket: Bucket
Random: Random
ModeHint: Bucket fills every line to its share. Random rolls every item, so the split is approximate.
BuyShortOn: Buy what is short
BuyShortOff: Do not buy
BuyShortHint: Buy missing materials from shopkeepers in reach, up to the budget.
Budget: Budget
Gold: gold
Save: Save order
SaveHint: Start the order, or update the selected one. What is already made stays.
NeedLines: Add at least one weapon or set first.
SetNeedsItem: Hold an armor piece on your cursor first.
SetNeedsArmor: That item is not part of an armor set.
OrderName: "{0} order"
OrderRefused: The order could not be saved.
RulesCount: "{0} standing buys attached."
SetOf: "{0} set"
StatusNew: Not started.
StatusWorking: Crafting.
StatusWaiting: Waiting for materials.
StatusDone: Done.
StatusPaused: Paused.
StatusNoRecipe: An item in it has no recipe.
StatusNoArmory: The armory is gone.
StatusError: Something went wrong.
StatusStation: Needs a {0} within 30 tiles.
StatusCondition: Needs: {0}
ChecklistTitle: Materials
ChecklistDraft: Estimate from this armory's storage.
ChecklistEmpty: Nothing needed.
AllCovered: Every material is covered.
SomeShort: "{0} materials are short."
BuyHeader: Standing buy
KindHint: Choose what to buy.
KindItem: One item
KindGun: Any gun
KindAmmo: Any ammo
AnyGunHint: Buys the best gun in stock.
AnyAmmoHint: Buys the best ammo in stock.
Count: Count
BuyNow: Buy now
BuyNowHint: Buy once, now, within the budget.
AddToOrder: Add to selected order
AddToOrderHint: The order buys this each time it runs, until the count or budget is met.
RuleAdded: Standing buys on this order: {0}. Save the order to keep them.
Offers: In reach
OfferHint: Click to buy this item.
NoShops: No shopkeepers are in reach.
Funds: Funds {0}
Bought: Bought {0} for {1}.
BoughtNothing: Nothing was bought.
SellHeader: Mass sell
CatAny: Any kind
CatHint: Pick a kind of item.
CatMelee: Melee
CatRanged: Ranged
CatMagic: Magic
CatSummon: Summon
CatArmor: Armor
CatAccessory: Accessories
CatAmmo: Ammo
CatPotion: Potions
CatOther: Other
TierAny: Any tier
TierHint: Pick a progression tier.
TierPreHardmode: Pre-Hardmode
TierEarlyHardmode: Early Hardmode
TierLateHardmode: Late Hardmode
TierEndgame: Endgame
SelectMatching: Select matching
SelectMatchingHint: Select every item of that kind and tier.
PickAFilter: Pick a kind or a tier first.
ClearSel: Clear selection
ShimmerOn: Shimmer back: on
ShimmerOff: Shimmer back: off
ShimmerHint: Items that shimmer apart return their materials instead of selling.
SellNow: Sell
SellNowHint: Sell the selection to the best-paying shopkeeper.
DragTip: Drag to select a block. Drag over a selected block to unselect it. Wheel scrolls.
SellNothing: Nothing selected.
SellInfo: "{0} selected. {2} pays {1}."
SellNoBuyer: "{0} selected. No shopkeeper is in reach."
Sold: Sold {0} items for {1} to {2}.
ShimmeredN: Shimmered {0} items back to materials.
SoldNothing: Nothing was sold.
FindSearch: Search items
FindClear: Clear
FindClearHint: Stop looking for an item.
FindCurrent: Finding: {0}
FindNone: Click an item to find it.
HeartNoNetwork: The Armory Heart reaches no storage network. Connect it to a Storage Heart with connectors.
HeartNetworked: Joined to the storage network. {0}
HeartNoArmory: No Armory is within reach of this heart.
